      "extract": "arXiv:1404.2541v1 [math.CA] 9 Apr 2014 The Stokes phenomenon for the Ramanujan’s q-diﬀerence equation and its higher order extension Takeshi MORITA∗ Abstract We show connection formulae of local solutions of the Ramanu- jan equation between the origin and the inﬁnity. These solutions are given by the Ramanujan function, the q-Airy function and the diver- gent basic hypergeometric series 2ϕ0(0, 0; −; q, x). We use",
