      "extract": "In this papar, we deal with the Ramanujan equation $$qxu(q^2x)-u(qx)+u(x)=0,\\qquad \\forall x\\in\\mathbb{C}^*. \\label{ramanujaneq}$$ We assume that $0<|q|<1$. The Ramanujan equation [\\[ramanujaneq\\]](#ramanujaneq){reference-type=\"eqref\" reference=\"ramanujaneq\"} has solutions $$\\begin{aligned} u_1(x)&={}_0\\varphi_1(-;0;q,-qx), \\\\ u_2(x)&=\\theta_q(x){}_2\\varphi_0\\left(0,0;-;q,-\\frac{x}{q}\\right)\\label{secondram}",
