      "extract": "We review two different $q$-exponential functions $e_q(x)$ and $E_q(x)$ to consider the connection problem on the Ramanujan equation. In this section, we show the relation between them. We review two different $q$-exponential functions from the viewpoint of the connection problems. One of the $q$-exponential function $e_q(x)$ is given by $$e_q(x):={}_1\\varphi_0 (0;-;q,x)=\\sum_{n\\ge 0}\\frac{x^n}{(q;q)_n}.$$ The other",
